  "obligation": "Dynamic-import result Promises survive queued and taken-batch lifetimes, then become collectible after settlement without external roots.",
  "representation": "Persistent dynamic_import_jobs is the queue authority. GC derives queued Promise roots from each job.promises. Taking a batch transfers every waiter into the existing with_call_roots scope until settlement or transfer to a persistent queue/module record. No second persistent waiter registry.",
